  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development would create a sense of enclosure&amp;nbsp;for occupiers of all habitable rooms which are within the immediate&amp;nbsp;proximity of the proposed&amp;nbsp;roof terrace area, with increased potential for noise and disturbance.&amp;nbsp;This, together with its largely unrestricted access and hours of use,&amp;nbsp;would be to the detriment of continued enjoyment of this&amp;nbsp;adjoining residential accommodation and is therefore contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 57 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
